{
  "version": 1,
  "meta": {
    "author": "delta",
    "updated": "2026-02-18T00:00:00Z",
    "notes": [
      "Strict JSON UTF-8; no comments; top-level keys ordered: version, meta, kinds, common_fields, kind_fields, validation_rules, examples.",
      "Schema is authoritative for MVP; loaders/validators consume this bespoke map (not JSON Schema draft-07).",
      "DEV mode rejects on violation; PROD clamps to bounds then warns (parity with component schemas).",
      "IDs are lowercase, dot-delimited, and stable across versions.",
      "Tools must have stack_size=1.",
      "Explicit mapping tool.mining_power → tile.hardness bands (0=floor, 3=rock, 4=ore.copper, 5=ore.iron, 7=ore.quartz) aligned with data/core/component-schemas.json.",
      "Material_type 'ore' must carry tag 'ore'.",
      "Rarity informs drop weights but is non-functional in MVP.",
      "Cross-ref: data/core/component-schemas.json defines tile.hardness bands and clamps used by mining.",
      "Cross-ref: data/crafting/recipes.json inputs/outputs must reference valid item ids described by this schema.",
      "Cross-ref: docs/technology-systems/crafting-design.md contains balancing/tuning notes used alongside this schema."
    ]
  },
  "kinds": [
    "material",
    "tool",
    "component",
    "consumable"
  ],
  "common_fields": {
    "id": {
      "name": "id",
      "type": "string",
      "required": true,
      "default": "",
      "min": null,
      "max": null,
      "enum": [],
